@startuml

actor Пациент
participant "WebUI\n(React)" as WebUI
participant "API Gateway\n(Kong)" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service\n(Spring Boot)" as Auth
participant "Data Upload Service\n(Spring Boot)" as Upload
participant "AWS S3" as S3
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as Queue
participant "Preprocessing Service\n(Python)" as Preproc
participant "ML Inference Service\n(TensorFlow Serving)" as ML
participant "GPU Cluster\n(NVIDIA T4)" as GPU
participant "Report Service\n(Node.js)" as Report
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "WebSocket\nNotifier" as WS
participant "Clinic MIS" as MIS

== Авторизация ==

Пациент -> WebUI: Вход (email, password)
activate WebUI

WebUI -> Gateway: POST /auth/login
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Auth: authenticate()
activate Auth

Auth -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email=?
activate DB
DB --> Auth: User
deactivate DB

Auth -> Auth: Проверка пароля (BCrypt)
Auth --> Gateway: JWT Token (TTL=15min)
deactivate Auth

Gateway --> WebUI: 200 OK + JWT
deactivate Gateway

WebUI --> Пациент: Успешная авторизация
deactivate WebUI

== Загрузка медицинских данных ==

Пациент -> WebUI: Загрузка изображения + симптомы
activate WebUI

WebUI -> Gateway: POST /upload (multipart/form-data)\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer {JWT}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway: Проверка JWT
Gateway -> Gateway: Rate Limiting (100 req/min)

Gateway -> Upload: uploadData()
activate Upload

Upload -> Upload: Валидация формата (JPEG/PNG)
Upload -> Upload: Проверка размера (≤10MB)

Upload -> S3: PUT /medical-images-raw/{userId}/{fileId}
activate S3
S3 -> S3: Шифрование AES-256
S3 --> Upload: S3 URL
deactivate S3

Upload -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_data
activate DB
DB --> Upload: Metadata saved
deactivate DB

Upload -> Queue: PUBLISH message\n{fileId, userId, s3Url, fileType}
activate Queue
Queue --> Upload: ACK
deactivate Queue

Upload --> Gateway: 201 Created + {fileId}
deactivate Upload

Gateway --> WebUI: 201 Created
deactivate Gateway

WebUI --> Пациент: Загрузка успешна
deactivate WebUI

== Препроцессинг ==

Queue -> Preproc: CONSUME message
activate Preproc

Preproc -> S3: GET /medical-images-raw/{userId}/{fileId}
activate S3
S3 --> Preproc: Image binary
deactivate S3

par Параллельный препроцессинг
    Preproc -> Preproc: OpenCV: декодирование
    Preproc -> Preproc: Изменение размера (224x224)
    Preproc -> Preproc: Нормализация ImageNet
    Preproc -> Preproc: Конвертация в float32 tensor
and
    Preproc -> DB: SELECT symptoms WHERE fileId=?
    activate DB
    DB --> Preproc: Text symptoms
    deactivate DB
    Preproc -> Preproc: BERT tokenization
    Preproc -> Preproc: input_ids + attention_mask
end

Preproc -> Queue: PUBLISH preprocessed data
activate Queue
Queue --> Preproc: ACK
deactivate Queue
deactivate Preproc

== ML Inference ==

Queue -> ML: CONSUME preprocessed data
activate ML

ML -> Redis: GET cache:{fileId}
activate Redis
Redis --> ML: null (cache miss)
deactivate Redis

ML -> GPU: gRPC predict(tensor_image)
activate GPU

GPU -> GPU: ResNet-50 forward pass
GPU -> GPU: Convolution layers
GPU -> GPU: Batch normalization
GPU -> GPU: Global average pooling
GPU --> ML: Logits
deactivate GPU

ML -> ML: Softmax activation
ML -> ML: Top-3 classes

ML -> GPU: gRPC predict(text_tokens)
activate GPU
GPU -> GPU: BERT forward pass
GPU -> GPU: Attention mechanism
GPU --> ML: Text embeddings
deactivate GPU

ML -> ML: Disease classification
ML -> ML: Combine image + text results

par Генерация объяснений
    ML -> GPU: Grad-CAM для изображения
    activate GPU
    GPU -> GPU: Градиенты + активации
    GPU --> ML: Heatmap PNG
    deactivate GPU
and
    ML -> ML: SHAP объяснения для текста
end

ML -> Redis: SET cache:{fileId} results (TTL=1h)
activate Redis
Redis --> ML: OK
deactivate Redis

ML -> DB: INSERT INTO diagnoses
activate DB
DB --> ML: Diagnosis saved
deactivate DB

ML -> Queue: PUBLISH results
activate Queue
Queue --> ML: ACK
deactivate Queue
deactivate ML

== Формирование отчёта ==

Queue -> Report: CONSUME results
activate Report

Report -> Report: Load Jinja2 template

par Параллельная генерация
    Report -> Report: PDFKit: generate PDF
    Report -> Report: Insert heatmap
    Report -> Report: Insert top-3 diagnoses
and
    Report -> Report: Generate HTML
    Report -> Report: Bootstrap 5 styling
end

Report -> S3: PUT /reports/{reportId}.pdf
activate S3
S3 --> Report: Report URL
deactivate S3

Report -> DB: UPDATE diagnoses SET report_url=?
activate DB
DB --> Report: OK
deactivate DB

Report -> WS: SEND notification\n{userId, reportId, status: "ready"}
activate WS
WS --> Пациент: Push уведомление
deactivate WS

alt Интеграция с MIS
    Report -> MIS: POST /reports\nRetry 3 times
    activate MIS
    MIS --> Report: 200 OK
    deactivate MIS
end

Report -> Queue: ACK message
activate Queue
deactivate Queue

deactivate Report

== Просмотр результатов ==

Пациент -> WebUI: Открыть отчёт
activate WebUI

WebUI -> Gateway: GET /reports/{reportId}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Report: getReport()
activate Report

Report -> Redis: GET report:{reportId}
activate Redis
Redis --> Report: Report data (from cache)
deactivate Redis

Report --> Gateway: Report JSON
deactivate Report

Gateway --> WebUI: 200 OK + Report
deactivate Gateway

WebUI --> Пациент: Отображение диагноза + heatmap
deactivate WebUI

@enduml

